==================== Input ====================
# A `|+` scalar with no content line keeps exactly its one trailing newline;
# counting the next entry's indentation as a blank would change the value
# from "\n" to "\n\n" (oxc#25484).
example:
  - |+

  - .
explicit-indent:
  - |+2

  - .
nested:
  keep: |+

  next: ok

